{"id":"vod_md_6658","vodId":"6658","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"排球少年第二季","name_cn":"排球少年第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231117-1/9fc913db86af0815b2322fc56987aed4.jpg"},"summary":"排球少年第二季剧情介绍：全集动画是排球少年的续集作品，排球少年第二季全集动画讲述的是小时候，日向翔阳从电视上看见排球比赛，乌野高中的一名小个子在球上的英姿，简直就是个“小巨人”，对此非常深刻，并开始迷上排球，一直想成为“小巨人”一样的人。初中时排球部不够人数，只好默默等待，后来在终于有新成员后，参与了第一次也是最后一赛的比赛，不幸对决了最强队伍，结果当然落败。单凭自己的话，是绝对无办法看见那景色的，不是自己一人的话，或许就能看见了…为了能够打出“胜利”的比赛，翔阳努力考入乌野高中，实现成为“小巨人”的排球梦想！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-17 10:27:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/adbpyZ0j/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/xf7USFSX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/x7HjZKte/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/I5T5ISvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/A3z2VCtz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/3wMHrjoH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/gQZo2RX9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/n59HyA7G/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/58eD222H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/90WQseHu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/mWHPpg9u/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/utovejms/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/Rsg8rYJk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/li3JPSK8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/NJbCs16v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://pla